he Channels and Impact of Debt on Economic Growth: Evidence from South Asia” written by Dr. Kashif Munir, Associate Professor, FASS is published on September 24, 2018 in the “South Asia Economic Journal”. http://journals.sagepub.com/doi/pdf/10.1177/1391561418794692 https://doi.org/10.1177/1391561418794692 Effect of economic growth, trade openness, urbanization, and technology on environment of Asian emerging economies An article titled “Effect of economic growth, trade openness, urbanization, and technology on environment of Asian emerging economies” written by Dr. Kashif Munir, Associate Professor, FASS is published online on July 27, 2018 in the ISI index (ESCI) master journal list “Management of Environmental Quality: An International Journal“. https://www.emeraldinsight.com/doi/full/10.1108/MEQ-05-2018-0087 https://doi.org/10.1108/MEQ-05-2018-0087 Are some taxes better for growth in Pakistan An article of Dr. Kashif Munir, Associate Professor titled “Are some taxes better for growth in Pakistan? A time series analysis” is published on line on August 12, 2018 in the ISI index (ESCI) master journal list “International Journal of Social Economics“. https://www.emeraldinsight.com/doi/full/10.1108/IJSE-09-2017-0416 https://doi.org/10.1108/IJSE-09-2017-0416 Export composition and economic growth An article titled “Export composition and economic growth: evidence from South Asian countries” written by Dr. Kashif Munir, Associate Professor, FASS, is published on line on June 12, 2018 in the ISI index (ESCI) master journal list “South Asian Journal of Business Studies“. https://www.emeraldinsight.com/doi/full/10.1108/SAJBS-10-2017-0117 https://doi.org/10.1108/SAJBS-10-2017-0117 Fiscal Policy and Macroeconomic Stability An article titled “Fiscal Policy and Macroeconomic Stability in South Asian Countries” jointly published by Dr. Kashif Munir and Ms. Nimra Riaz, on line on 25 June, 2018 in the ISI index (SSCI) master journal list (Impact factor, JCR) of HEC “Review of Pub