 or by UCP. We hope that the forthcoming issues of these newsletters add more information to the UCPs hall of fame. For yet another better version, any inevitable suggestions and creative ideas are welcomed, from students and faculty equally. 2017-18 December 2016 June 2016 International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "UCP TIMES - University of Central Punjab", "sizeKb": 214.7, "matches": [], "rawHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<!--[if IE 7]>\\n<html class=\\"ie ie7\\" lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<![endif]-->\\n<!--[if IE 8]>\\n<html class=\\"ie ie8\\" lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<![endif]-->\\n<!--[if !(IE 7) | !(IE 8)  ]><!-->\\n<html lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<!--<![endif]-->\\n<head><meta charset=\\"UTF-8\\" ><script>if(navigator.userAgent.match(/MSIE|Internet Explorer/i)||navigator.userAgent.match(/Trident\\\\/7\\\\..*?rv:11/i)){var href=document.location.href;if(!href.match(/[?&]nowprocket/)){if(href.indexOf(\\"?\\")==-1){if(href.indexOf(\\"#\\")==-1){document.location.href=href+\\"?nowprocket=1\\"}else{document.location.href=href.replace(\\"#\\",\\"?nowprocket=1#\\")}}else{if(href.indexOf(\\"#\\")==-1){document.location.href=href+\\"&nowprocket=1\\"}else{document.location.href=href.replace(\\"#\\",\\"&nowprocket=1#\\")}}}}</script><script>(()=>{class RocketLazyLoadScripts{constructor(){this.v=\\"1.2.6\\",this.triggerEvents=[\\"keydown\\",\\"mousedown\\",\\"mousemove\\",\\"touchmove\\",\\"touchstart\\",\\"touchend\\",\\"wheel\\"],this.userEventHandler=this.t.bind(this),this.touchStartHandler=this.i.bind(this),this.touchMoveHandler=this.o.bind(this),this.touchEndHandler=this.h.bind(this),this.clickHandler=this.u.bind(this),this.interceptedClicks=[],this.interceptedClickListeners=[],this.l(this),window.addEventListener(\\"pageshow\\",(t=