.pk/exam-office/\\">Exam Office</a></li>\\n<li id=\\"menu-item-70403\\" class=\\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-70403\\"><a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/inc/uploads/2019/01/SEXUALHARASSMENT-POLICY.pdf\\">Harassment Policy</a></li>\\n<li id=\\"menu-item-70404\\" class=\\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-70404\\"><a href=\\"/ucp-scholarships/\\">Scholarships</a></li>\\n<li id=\\"menu-item-70405\\" class=\\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-70405\\"><a href=\\"/news/career-opportunities/\\">Jobs</a></li>\\n<li id=\\"menu-item-94064\\" class=\\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-94064\\"><a href=\\"https://horizon.ucp.edu.pk/verify\\">Verify Student</a></li>\\n<li id=\\"menu-item-80999\\" class=\\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-80999\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/tender-notice/\\">Tender Notice</a></li>\\n<li id=\\"menu-item-80658\\" class=\\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-80658\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/faqs/\\">FAQs</a></li>\\n</ul></div></div></div><div id=\\"text-33\\" class=\\" col-md-3  footercol3 widget widget_text\\"><div class=\\" widget-inner\\"><h2 class=\\"widget-title maincolor1\\">CONTACT US</h2>\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"textwid\\n\\n[Truncated for database storage]", "wordCount": 44, "matchPages": 32, "matchWords": 15, "commonWords": 15, "uniqueWords": 29, "matchPercent": 34, "commonPercent": 34, "duplicateWords": 0, "duplicatePercent": 0}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/lab-supervisors-mechanical-engineering/", "text": "Lab Supervisors - Mechanical Engineering Home » News » Lab Supervisors – Mechanical Engineering University of Central Punjab is looking for a responsible and dedicated individuals to immediately fill vacant positions of Lab Supervisors (Mechanical Engineering), as per details given below: Job Type: Full-Time Job Location: Mechanical Engineering Department, UCP, Johar Town, Lahore Qualification: DAE in Mechanical / Auto Diesel Technology from a well-reputed institute with at least 70% marks in both Matriculation and DAE Experience: 2-5 years of work experience in the relevant field (e.g. design, fabrication, machining, auto-diesel etc) Salary Package: Commensurate with the technical know-how, skills and competencies of the candidate Skills Required: The candidate must have full command of CAD software (e.g. Creo/ Pro-E, AutoCAD, Solid Works) and MS Office (Word, Excel, Power Point). Candidates with good oral and written communication skills will be preferred. Prospective candidates may send their applications along with attested copies of their testimonials and CNIC latest by 1st March, 2018 at the address given below: University of Central Punjab 1 Khayaban e Jinnah, Johar Town, Lahore. Hafiz Fahad in Mechanical Engineering Block. CV can also be emailed to: muhammad.fahad@ucp.edu.pk International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "Lab Supervisors - Mechanical Engineering - UCP", "sizeKb": 207.7, "matches": [], "rawHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<!--[if IE 7]>\\n<html class=\\"ie ie7\\" lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<![endif]-->\\n<!--[if IE 8]>\\n<html class=\\"ie ie8\\" lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<![endif]-->\\n<!--[if !(IE 7) | !(IE 8)  ]><!-->\\n<html lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<!--<![endif]-->\\n<head><meta charset=\\"UTF-8\\" ><script>if(navigator.userAgent.match(/MSIE|Internet Explorer/i)||navigator.userAgent.match(/Trident\\\\/7\\\\..*?rv:11/i)){var href=document.location.href;if(!href.match(/[?&]nowprocket/)){if(href.indexOf(\\"?\\")==-1){if(href.indexOf(\\"#\\")==-1){document.location.href=href+\\"?nowprocket=1\\"}else{docume