  <h1>Levi’s Recruitment Drive For The Positions Of Store Managers</h1>\\n                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"pathway col-md-4 col-sm-4 hidden-xs text-right\\">\\n                     <div id=\\"crumbs\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk\\">Home</a> &raquo; <a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/./news/\\">News</a> &raquo; <span class=\\"current\\">Levi’s Recruitment Drive For The Positions Of Store Managers</span></div>                </div>\\n                            </div><!--/row-->\\n        </div><!--/container-->\\n    </div><!--/page-heading-->\\n\\n<div class=\\"top-sidebar\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                    </div><!--/row-->\\n    </div><!--/container-->\\n</div><!--/Top sidebar-->\\t<div id=\\"bsf_rt_marker\\"></div><p>Directorate of Placement &amp; External Linkages in collaboration with Levi’s Pakistan arranged Recruitment Drive for 6 posts of Store Managers on March 14, 2017. Ms. Mehreen Jahanzeb, HR Executive –Levi’s conducted Interviews.<br >\\n25 students from Business School were screened out for the said post. Officials from Levi’s appreciated the zeal &amp; positive response of UCP students.</p>\\n\\n<!-- <a class=\\"apply-online-side back-side\\" href=\\"https://online-admissions.ucp.edu.pk/\\" title=\\"Apply Online\\"  style=\\"bottom: 71%;\\">Apply Online</a>\\n<a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://cpe.ucp.edu.pk/\\" title=\\"Merit List\\"  style=\\"bottom: 52%;right: -27px;\\">UCP-CPE</a>\\n<a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/date-sheets/\\" title=\\"Date Sheets\\"  style=\\"bottom: 36%;\\">Date Sheets</a>\\n<a class=\\"apply-online-side \\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/girls-hostel/\\" title=\\"Girls Hostel\\"  style=\\"bottom: 19%;right: -33px;\\">Girls Hostel</a> -->\\n<!-- <a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/announcement/25th-convocation/\\" title=\\"25th Convocation\\"  style=\\"bottom: 54%;right: -5