RIC </a></li>\\n                          </ul>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div><!-- /.navbar-collapse -->\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n\\t\\t        </nav>\\n    </div><!-- #main-nav -->\\n        </header>\\t    <div class=\\"page-heading\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-md-8 col-sm-8\\">\\n                    <h1>Faculty Of Sciences</h1>\\n                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"pathway col-md-4 col-sm-4 hidden-xs text-right\\">\\n                     <div id=\\"crumbs\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk\\">Home</a> &raquo; <a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/./news/\\">News</a> &raquo; <span class=\\"current\\">Faculty Of Sciences</span></div>                </div>\\n                            </div><!--/row-->\\n        </div><!--/container-->\\n    </div><!--/page-heading-->\\n\\n<div class=\\"top-sidebar\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                    </div><!--/row-->\\n    </div><!--/container-->\\n</div><!--/Top sidebar-->\\t<div id=\\"bsf_rt_marker\\"></div><p>University of Central Punjab, keeping its tradition of providing modern education, has embarked upon a new journey. Dr. Rizwana Kausar has been appointed In-charge of the new faculty. Various departments of sciences like Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Botany, Zoology and Statistics have been added to the faculty as well. Pro Rector, who inaugurated the faculty, and in-charge of the faculty sincerely hope that this department of sciences would provide students with more exploratory array of subjects. Distinguished Deans, faculty and students were present at this notable occasion.</p>\\n\\n<!-- <a class=\\"apply-online-side back-side\\" href=\\"https://online-admissions.ucp.edu.pk/\\" title=\\"Apply Online\\"  style=\\"bottom: 71%;\\">Apply Online</a>\\n<a class=\\"ap