ession with students. Prof. Tahir Ashfaq, Director Student Affairs, Placements & External Linkages delivered the vote of thanks and presented the souvenir to Chief Guest. International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "Seminar on General Awareness of Traffic Law - UCP", "sizeKb": 176, "matches": [{"text": "International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "type": "common", "matchPages": [{"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/faculty-of-sciences/", "title": "Faculty of Sciences - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/skype-chat-session-with-the-head-of-school-massey-university-new-zealand/", "title": "Skype Chat Session with The Head of School, Massey University NZ"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/guest-lecture/", "title": "Guest Lecture - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/session-on-disaster-management-awareness-investigating-today-to-save-lives-tomorrow/", "title": "Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/psychology-society-seminar/", "title": "Psychology Society Seminar - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/levis-recruitment-drive-for-the-positions-of-store-managers/", "title": "Levi’s Recruitment Drive for The Positions of Store Managers - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/ramadan/", "title": "Ramadan - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/trophy-comes-home/", "title": "Trophy Comes Home - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/cultural-carnival/", "title": "Cultural Carnival - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/shab-e-midhat/", "title": "Shab-e-Midhat - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/market