em-94065\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-1 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://horizon.ucp.edu.pk/verify\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Verify Student </a></li>\\n\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-85679\\" class=\\"main-menu-item menu-item-depth-0 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/blog/\\" class=\\"menu-link  main-menu-link\\">Blog </a></li>\\n<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-112477\\" class=\\"main-menu-item menu-item-depth-0 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://oric.ucp.edu.pk/\\" class=\\"menu-link  main-menu-link\\">ORIC </a></li>\\n                          </ul>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div><!-- /.navbar-collapse -->\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n\\t\\t        </nav>\\n    </div><!-- #main-nav -->\\n        </header>\\t    <div class=\\"page-heading\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-md-8 col-sm-8\\">\\n                    <h1>Seminar On General Awareness Of Traffic Laws</h1>\\n                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"pathway col-md-4 col-sm-4 hidden-xs text-right\\">\\n                     <div id=\\"crumbs\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk\\">Home</a> &raquo; <a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/./news/\\">News</a> &raquo; <span class=\\"current\\">Seminar On General Awareness Of Traffic Laws</span></div>                </div>\\n                            </div><!--/row-->\\n        </div><!--/container-->\\n    </div><!--/page-heading-->\\n\\n<div class=\\"top-sidebar\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                    </div><!--/row-->\\n    </div><!--/container-->\\n</div><!--/Top sidebar-->\\t<div id=\\"bsf_rt_marker\\"></div><p>UCP Students Council Office in collaboration with City Traffic Police organized an awareness session on &#8220;General Laws of Traffic on 4th April, 2017 at UCP Auditorium. Students were briefed about fundamental road safety procedures, and lack of road etiquettes prevailing amongst the youth. The purpose of seminar was to aware students regarding the importance of General Traffic Laws set by the City Traffic Police. Mr. Rai Ejaz Ahmed, CTO (SSP) was the Chief Guest and he conducted interactive session with students. Prof. Tahir Ashfaq, Director Student Affairs, Placements &amp; External Linkages delivered the vote of thanks and presented the souvenir to Chief Guest.<br >\\n&nbsp;<br >\\n\\n\\t\\t<style type=\\"text/css\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tmargin: auto;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 .gallery-item {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tfloat: left;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tmargin-top: 10px;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttext-align: center;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\twidth: 20%;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 img {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 .gallery-caption {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tmargin-left: 0;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes/media.php */\\n\\t\\t</style>\\n\\t\\t<div id=\'gallery-2\' class=\'gallery galleryid-3340 gallery-columns-5 gallery-size-thumbnail\'><dl class=\'gallery-item\'>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt class=\'gallery-icon landscape\'>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\'https://ucp.edu.pk/1-1/\'><img decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"150\\" height=\\"150\\" src=\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%20viewBox=\'0%200%20150%20150\'%3E%3C/svg%3E\\" class=\\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\\" alt=\\"\\" data-lazy-srcset=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/1-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/1-1-50x50.jpg 50w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/1-1-80x80.jpg 80w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/1-1-263x263.jpg 263w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/1-1-1