rship About: Volunteer in Service (VIS) department has become a member of United Nations Academic Impact (UNAI), a prestigious institution working under United Nations, initiated in 2010 by the orders of General Secretary UNO Ban Ki-moon. UNAI has issued a membership certificate to UCP to confirm the membership. UCP is among 13 UNAI member universities from Pakistan and 1200 universities from around the world from 120 countries. The aim of UNAI is to align institutions of higher education with the United Nations to further the realization of the purposes and mandate of UNO through activities and research in a shared culture of intellectual social responsibility. International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "United Nations Academic Impact Membership - UCP", "sizeKb": 208.9, "matches": [{"text": "International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "type": "common", "matchPages": [{"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/faculty-of-sciences/", "title": "Faculty of Sciences - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/seminar-on-general-awareness-of-traffic-laws/", "title": "Seminar on General Awareness of Traffic Law - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/skype-chat-session-with-the-head-of-school-massey-university-new-zealand/", "title": "Skype Chat Session with The Head of School, Massey University NZ"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/guest-lecture/", "title": "Guest Lecture - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/session-on-disaster-management-awareness-investigating-today-to-save-lives-tomorrow/", "title": "Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/psychology-society-seminar/", "title": "Psychology Society Seminar - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/levis-recruitment-drive-for-the-positions-of