in UCP. This lab is part of a larger network of labs under the umbrella of National Center of Robotics and Automation (NCRA), an initiative of the planning commission of Pakistan. The lab in UCP shall conduct cutting-edge research in the area of Rehabilitation Robotics, aimed at developing novel cost-effective exoskeleton devices to help disabled persons walk again. Dr. Zohaib leads the BioMechatronics research group in UCP and is with the university since 2013. International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "Dr. Zohaib Aftab Wins Research Grant from the Govt. of Pakistan - University of Central Punjab", "sizeKb": 207.4, "matches": [{"text": "International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "type": "common", "matchPages": [{"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/faculty-of-sciences/", "title": "Faculty of Sciences - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/seminar-on-general-awareness-of-traffic-laws/", "title": "Seminar on General Awareness of Traffic Law - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/skype-chat-session-with-the-head-of-school-massey-university-new-zealand/", "title": "Skype Chat Session with The Head of School, Massey University NZ"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/guest-lecture/", "title": "Guest Lecture - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/session-on-disaster-management-awareness-investigating-today-to-save-lives-tomorrow/", "title": "Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/psychology-society-seminar/", "title": "Psychology Society Seminar - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/levis-recruitment-drive-for-the-positions-of-store-managers/", "title": "Levi’s Recruitment Drive for The Positions of Store Managers - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/ramadan/", 