Student </a></li>\\n\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-85679\\" class=\\"main-menu-item menu-item-depth-0 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/blog/\\" class=\\"menu-link  main-menu-link\\">Blog </a></li>\\n<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-112477\\" class=\\"main-menu-item menu-item-depth-0 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://oric.ucp.edu.pk/\\" class=\\"menu-link  main-menu-link\\">ORIC </a></li>\\n                          </ul>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div><!-- /.navbar-collapse -->\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n\\t\\t        </nav>\\n    </div><!-- #main-nav -->\\n        </header>\\t    <div class=\\"page-heading\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-md-8 col-sm-8\\">\\n                    <h1>Session On Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today To Save Lives Tomorrow</h1>\\n                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"pathway col-md-4 col-sm-4 hidden-xs text-right\\">\\n                     <div id=\\"crumbs\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk\\">Home</a> &raquo; <a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/./news/\\">News</a> &raquo; <span class=\\"current\\">Session On Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today To Save Lives Tomorrow</span></div>                </div>\\n                            </div><!--/row-->\\n        </div><!--/container-->\\n    </div><!--/page-heading-->\\n\\n<div class=\\"top-sidebar\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                    </div><!--/row-->\\n    </div><!--/container-->\\n</div><!--/Top sidebar-->\\t<div id=\\"bsf_rt_marker\\"></div><p>UCP Disaster Management Society organized Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating today to save lives tomorrow on 5th April, 2017. Mr. Mehr Ijaz Ahmed Achlana, Provincial Minister Disaster Management was Chief Guest of the ceremony. Mr. Rao Zaka ur Rehman, Manager Provincial Disaster Management Red Crescent Punjab and Mr. James Ulin, Regional Security Officer Lahore Pakistan were the Guest Speakers. The purpose of conducting this seminar was to create awareness regarding disasters and how to effectively manage them. Dr. Ayesha Azhar, Patron Disaster Management Society delivered the Welcome Note while Dr. Muhammad Zafarullah, Pro-Rector UCP delivered the vote of thanks. Session was culminated with Question Answer Session and presentation of Souvenirs.<br >\\n&nbsp;<br >\\n\\n\\t\\t<style type=\\"text/css\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tmargin: auto;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 .gallery-item {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tfloat: left;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tmargin-top: 10px;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttext-align: center;\\n\\t\\t\\t\\twidth: 20%;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 img {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t#gallery-2 .gallery-caption {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tmargin-left: 0;\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes/media.php */\\n\\t\\t</style>\\n\\t\\t<div id=\'gallery-2\' class=\'gallery galleryid-3377 gallery-columns-5 gallery-size-thumbnail\'><dl class=\'gallery-item\'>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt class=\'gallery-icon landscape\'>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\'https://ucp.edu.pk/d2/\'><img decoding=\\"async\\" width=\\"150\\" height=\\"150\\" src=\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%20viewBox=\'0%200%20150%20150\'%3E%3C/svg%3E\\" class=\\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\\" alt=\\"\\" data-lazy-srcset=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/d2-150x150.jpg 150w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/d2-50x50.jpg 50w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/d2-80x80.jpg 80w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/d2-263x263.jpg 263w, https://ucp.edu.pk/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/d2-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ucp.