r to join hands with it in a successful collaboration. To materialize this vision Psychology department joined hands with MILLS for a common venture. MILLS is a research-driven social enterprise, which has been researching on factors driving Pakistan’s poor performance ranking on Global Innovation Index. For this purpose a seminar was conducted under the supervision of Omayer Arshad, the Principle Consultant of MILLS, on 21st March, 2017 to explain the aim and objectives of this organization to the students of psychology dept. Focus of the seminar was: Develop new learning, Emphasize on role of self-directed behaviors, Leadership and success skills. Followed by the seminar was a fun-based Legos activity in which the faculty as well as the students of Psychology Department took part. Overall seminar was interactive and learning based. International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "Psychology Society Seminar - University of Central Punjab", "sizeKb": 166.9, "matches": [{"text": "International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "type": "common", "matchPages": [{"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/faculty-of-sciences/", "title": "Faculty of Sciences - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/seminar-on-general-awareness-of-traffic-laws/", "title": "Seminar on General Awareness of Traffic Law - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/skype-chat-session-with-the-head-of-school-massey-university-new-zealand/", "title": "Skype Chat Session with The Head of School, Massey University NZ"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/guest-lecture/", "title": "Guest Lecture - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/session-on-disaster-management-awareness-investigating-today-to-save-lives-tomorrow/", "title": "Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.p