battery-full.png\');}\\",\\"hash\\":\\"afc44f80-0333-40ef-997d-3068a9a98d30\\",\\"url\\":\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/ucp.edu.pk\\\\/wp-content\\\\/plugins\\\\/js_composer\\\\/assets\\\\/images\\\\/icons\\\\/battery-full.png\\"},{\\"selector\\":\\".vc_pixel_icon-binocular\\",\\"style\\":\\".vc_pixel_icon-binocular{--wpr-bg-7845fb1a-ec53-47dc-9e25-3910d86a4\\n\\n[Truncated for database storage]", "wordCount": 252, "matchPages": 32, "matchWords": 15, "commonWords": 15, "uniqueWords": 237, "matchPercent": 6, "commonPercent": 6, "duplicateWords": 0, "duplicatePercent": 0}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/ucp-dice-2018/", "text": "UCP at DICE 2018 Home » News » UCP at DICE 2018 A mega event of its own kind DICE(Distinguished Innovations, Collaboration and Entrepreneurship) 2018 was hosted by IBA Sukkur this year. This 2 day event comprised of participation of 600+ students representing more than 150 teams from the 70 different mainstream universities nationwide. It’s never too late or too early to pursue your dreams of being a business owner and keeping this motto in mind, our ambitious youngsters had their own business plans. UCP’s Entrepreneurs participated in 2 dominant categories in this event i.e. Group A (Engineering& Technology, Computer Sciences and Information Technology) and Group C (Arts & Humanities, Business and Social Sciences). Our successful entrepreneurs know how to move up the ladder and can make their income with their own innovative ideas. Our young IT experts’ secured 1st position in Group A by presenting their ingenious project whereas ZAPS team wowed everyone from the jury and bagged 3rd position in GroupC. This event boosted the morale of our extremely talented students and we anxiously wait for such events where the young talent gets the chance to showcase their remarkable work. We take immense pleasure that such bright stars are part of our institute and hope that they will keep on making us proud in the same manner. International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "UCP at DICE 2018 - University of Central Punjab", "sizeKb": 208.1, "matches": [{"text": "International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "type": "common", "matchPages": [{"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/faculty-of-sciences/", "title": "Faculty of Sciences - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/seminar-on-general-awareness-of-traffic-laws/", "title": "Seminar on General Awareness of Traffic Law - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/skype-chat-session-with-the-head-of-school-massey-university-new-zealand/", "title": "Skype Chat Session with The Head of School, Massey University NZ"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/guest-lecture/", "title": "Guest Lecture - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/session-on-disaster-management-awareness-investigating-today-to-save-lives-tomorrow/", "title": "Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/psychology-society-seminar/", "title": "Psychology Society Seminar - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/levis-recruitment-drive-for-the-positions-of-store-managers/", "title": "Levi’s Recruitment Drive for The Positions of Store Managers - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/ramadan/", "title": "Ramadan - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/trophy-comes-home/", "title": "Trophy Comes Home - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/cultural-carnival/", "title": "Cultural Carnival - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/shab-e-midhat/", "title": "Shab-e-Midhat - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/marketing-gala/", "title": "Marketing Gala - University of Central Pun