 2018 - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/notification-holiday/", "title": "Notification Holiday - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/ucp-mun-iii-2018/", "title": "UCP MUN III - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/ucp-business-school-kbw-2018/", "title": "UCP Business School at the KBW 2018 - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/talent-gala-high-achievers-award/", "title": "Talent Gala High Achievers Award - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/ucp-foe-achieves-level-ii-obe/", "title": "UCP FOE achieves Level-II OBE - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/blog/university-campus-life/", "title": "UCP 101, a Beginners Guide to an Amazing Journey - University of Central Punjab"}]}], "rawHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<!--[if IE 7]>\\n<html class=\\"ie ie7\\" lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<![endif]-->\\n<!--[if IE 8]>\\n<html class=\\"ie ie8\\" lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<![endif]-->\\n<!--[if !(IE 7) | !(IE 8)  ]><!-->\\n<html lang=\\"en-US\\" prefix=\\"og: http://ogp.me/ns# fb: http://ogp.me/ns/fb#\\">\\n<!--<![endif]-->\\n<head><meta charset=\\"UTF-8\\" ><script>if(navigator.userAgent.match(/MSIE|Internet Explorer/i)||navigator.userAgent.match(/Trident\\\\/7\\\\..*?rv:11/i)){var href=document.location.href;if(!href.match(/[?&]nowprocket/)){if(href.indexOf(\\"?\\")==-1){if(href.indexOf(\\"#\\")==-1){document.location.href=href+\\"?nowprocket=1\\"}else{document.location.href=href.replace(\\"#\\",\\"?nowprocket=1#\\")}}else{if(href.indexOf(\\"#\\")==-1){document.location.href=href+\\"&nowprocket=1\\"}else{document.location.href=href.replace(\\"#\\",\\"&nowprocket=1#\\")}}}}</script><script>(()=>{class RocketLazyLoadScripts{constructor(){this.v=\\"1.2.6\\",this.triggerEvents=[\\"keydown\\",\\"mou