t-custom menu-item-has-children parent dropdown-submenu\\"><a href=\\"#\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Portals </a>\\n\\t<ul class=\\"dropdown-menu menu-depth-2\\">\\n\\t\\t<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-71132\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-2 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://portal.ucp.edu.pk/login?returnUrl=%2F\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Student </a></li>\\n\\t\\t<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-71133\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-2 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://cms.ucp.edu.pk/\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Teacher </a></li>\\n\\t\\t<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-71134\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-2 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"http://alumni.ucp.edu.pk/\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Alumni </a></li>\\n\\n\\t</ul>\\n</li>\\n\\t<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-74564\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-1 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/academic-calendar/\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Academic Calendar </a></li>\\n\\t<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-74563\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-1 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/rules-regulations/\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Rules &#038; Regulations 2025 </a></li>\\n\\t<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-94065\\" class=\\"sub-menu-item menu-item-depth-1 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://horizon.ucp.edu.pk/verify\\" class=\\"menu-link  sub-menu-link\\">Verify Student </a></li>\\n\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-85679\\" class=\\"main-menu-item menu-item-depth-0 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/blog/\\" class=\\"menu-link  main-menu-link\\">Blog </a></li>\\n<li id=\\"nav-menu-item-112477\\" class=\\"main-menu-item menu-item-depth-0 menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\\"><a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://oric.ucp.edu.pk/\\" class=\\"menu-link  main-menu-link\\">ORIC </a></li>\\n                          </ul>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div><!-- /.navbar-collapse -->\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n\\t\\t        </nav>\\n    </div><!-- #main-nav -->\\n        </header>\\t    <div class=\\"page-heading\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-md-8 col-sm-8\\">\\n                    <h1>8 Things To Know Before Getting Admission In A University</h1>\\n                </div>\\n                                <div class=\\"pathway col-md-4 col-sm-4 hidden-xs text-right\\">\\n                     <div id=\\"crumbs\\"><a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk\\">Home</a> &raquo; <a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/./news/\\">News</a> &raquo; <span class=\\"current\\">8 Things To Know Before Getting Admission In A University</span></div>                </div>\\n                            </div><!--/row-->\\n        </div><!--/container-->\\n    </div><!--/page-heading-->\\n\\n<div class=\\"top-sidebar\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                    </div><!--/row-->\\n    </div><!--/container-->\\n</div><!--/Top sidebar-->\\t<div id=\\"bsf_rt_marker\\"></div><p>University is a very important milestone and significant time in the life of a student. Choosing a university can be exhausting since there are many things that have to be considered before getting <a href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/admission-in-university/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\"><strong>admission in university</strong></a>. University not only caters the academic needs of a student but also is important to build a career oriented professional. It plays a vital role in the development of a student both professionally and behaviorally. For a student to take admission it is important for the university to have a reputation for the courses that it offers and good reputed faculty. Below are a few points that should be considered before getting admission in a university:</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong><u>Admission/Graduation Rate</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>While getting admission in a university, it is important to know its admission/graduation rate; this evaluation is important while comparing universities and choosing the one that suits you best, since you will be investing your money and a major part of your time. It is important to evaluate the rate of admission in the university and then how many actually leave after graduation, there would be many that would leave before even completing the university. Students withdrawal before graduation may not necessarily mean that the university is not good, you will have to make an effort to look into the reasons that why a number of students left. Do not reject a university on the basis of admission/graduation rate, no institute may be perfect, you just have to focus on the advantages that suit you. To get a deeper insight and clear your doubts you can visit the university and discuss in the admissions department.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"2\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Finances</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>Planning for the admission in university does bring some financial anxiety as it can be costly to attend one. Universities generally prefer rich students, but it doesn’t mean that less fortunate ones are neglected. If you feel that you need to be supported financially then it should be mentioned in your application. In case you meet the requirements then it’s all good but if by any means you think that you should be supported then you must mention it. This won’t hold anything against you in the admission process, but might be beneficial if you are really in need.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"3\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Location </u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>Before taking admission you need to check where the university is located. If it is within the country then it is important to know the area so that you know the routes and distances. Also to make sure whether you would need live-in facilities or will be approaching from home. If you are taking admission in university of a foreign country, there are a number of things that you must consider, some of which are the weather of the country, type of food available, local language, interests of the people, social life, and how many people from your country prefer that place for study. If any of the before mentioned doesn’t suit you, then you would not be a very happy student since suitable living conditions matter.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"4\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Quality of education/professors</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>To best judge the quality of the education of a university you have to look into its graduate students, where they work and on what posts they are settled, keeping in mind that this cannot be judged by just a couple of students. Check the results of the university, how have the students been scoring?  Do talk to students and take their views. Inquire about the environment of the university, and the professors. It is also very important to know how the professors are, specially the subjects they teach and how good they are at it. Learn about their teaching methodologies, the results they have been producing, and the number of students that turn over to them for guidance.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"5\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Known courses for study</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>Along with all the other important things it is very important to know the area in which the university excels, the subjects that it is known for. All universities may not be good in teaching all the subjects, for instance a medical college would not be able to teach computers and the university of law would be able to teach sciences. So know whether the university that you want to take admission in caters the subjects you require well or not. See where the students of the particular field are placed, get to know the professors and check the results of the subjects that you are interested in. Keep in mind that the university that you are applying in may be a good choice but not the right one for the subjects that you want to master.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"6\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Extracurricular activities</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>‘A healthy body keeps a healthy mind’ is an old phrase but works well at every stage. Student life and on top of it being in a university, this is the prime time in the life of a human to learn all the good things and add them to their life so that they may excel not only in studies but in all the aspects of life. The university that you are opting for may be a very good choice but if it doesn’t support or have room for extra-curricular then know that you are about to become a book-worm. In your prospective university look for the magazine club, sports club, drama, volunteering. Taking part in extracurricular boosts up the energy to work and the knowledge about various subjects. If you are a writer and enjoy books, it’s a plus to have magazine club where you would be able to use your talent well. Sports are important for physical health, drama can open new doors of entertainment industry and volunteering helps rejuvenate the soul. Actively participating in other activities help to increase the confidence and believing in oneself. Also check whether the university is providing the Leadership opportunities or not. A university that instills the leadership qualities in its students help them go long way in life.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"7\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Career services</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>It is very important to know whether your prospective university provides career services or not. The major role of career services is to counsel and train the student for the upcoming professional life. At the university while completing your studies you can always turn to the career services office for proper guideline. There are many universities that arrange internships for their students later which can either convert to a full time paying job or can help acquire a job. See that the university you are planning for your admission has staff to guide the students for their professional choices.</p>\\n<ol start=\\"8\\">\\n<li><strong><u>Safety</u></strong></li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>Last but not the least, a secure environment counts the most. Check where your university is located, whether the location is safe or not. Note whether it has closed surroundings or not, check the building for proper safety measures that have been taken or not. See if the students are provide proper university identity cards and access to enter is solely on the identification of the student. The persons entering are gone through a proper security check and no trespassers are allowed. Do see how many entry access points are there.</p>\\n\\n<!-- <a class=\\"apply-online-side back-side\\" href=\\"https://online-admissions.ucp.edu.pk/\\" title=\\"Apply Online\\"  style=\\"bottom: 71%;\\">Apply Online</a>\\n<a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://cpe.ucp.edu.pk/\\" title=\\"Merit List\\"  style=\\"bottom: 52%;right: -27px;\\">UCP-CPE</a>\\n<a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/date-sheets/\\" title=\\"Date Sheets\\"  style=\\"bottom: 36%;\\">Date Sheets</a>\\n<a class=\\"apply-online-side \\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/girls-hostel/\\" title=\\"Girls Hostel\\"  style=\\"bottom: 19%;right: -33px;\\">Girls Hostel</a> -->\\n<!-- <a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/announcement/25th-convocation/\\" title=\\"25th Convocation\\"  style=\\"bottom: 54%;right: -52px;\\">25th Convocation</a> -->\\n<!-- <a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://www.ucp.edu.pk/announcement/ucp-vaccination-centre-announcement/\\" title=\\"On-Campus Vaccination\\"  style=\\"bottom: 25%;right: -103px;\\">On-Campus Vaccination</a> -->\\n<!--<a class=\\"apply-online-side\\" href=\\"https://www.ucp.edu.pk/ramadan-time-table/\\"  title=\\"Ramadan Time Table\\" style=\\"bottom: 50%;\\"><img width=\\"23\\" height=\\"150\\" src=\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%20viewBox=\'0%200%2023%20150\'%3E%3C/svg%3E\\" alt=\\"Ramadan Time Table\\" data-lazy-src=\\"https://www.ucp.edu.pk/inc/uploads/2020/04/btn_ucp_Ramadan.png\\"><noscript><img width=\\"23\\" height=\\"150\\" src=\\"https://www.ucp.edu.pk/inc/uploads/2020/04/btn_ucp_Ramadan.png\\" alt=\\"Ramadan Time Table\\"></noscript></a>-->\\n<div id=\\"bottom-sidebar\\">\\n    <div class=\\"container\\">\\n        <div class=\\"row normal-sidebar\\">\\n                    </div>\\n    </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<footer class=\\"dark-div main-color-2-bg university\\">\\n    <div id=\\"bottom\\">\\n        <div class=\\"section-inner\\">\\n            <div class=\\"container\\">\\n                <div class=\\"row normal-sidebar\\">\\n                    <div id=\\"text-32\\" class=\\" col-md-3  footercol3 widget widget_text\\"><div class=\\" widget-inner\\">\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"textwidget\\"><img width=\\"250\\" height=\\"89\\" src=\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%20viewBox=\'0%200%20250%2089\'%3E%3C/svg%3E\\" style=\\"width: 250px;padding-bottom: 0;margin-left: -8px;\\" data-lazy-src=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/static/uploads/2017/03/ucp-logof.png\\"><noscript><img width=\\"250\\" height=\\"89\\" src=\\"https://ucp.edu.pk/static/uploads/2017/03/ucp-logof.png\\" style=\\"width: 250px;padding-bottom: 0;margin-left: -8px;\\"></noscript>\\r\\n<br><br>\\r\\n<div class=\\"social-footer\\">\\r\\n    <ul class=\\"list-inline pull-right social-list csssocl\\">\\r\\n    <li><a href=\\"https://www.facebook.com/UCPofficial\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-facebook\\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n    <li><a href=\\"https://www.twitter.com/UCPofficial\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-twitter\\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n    <li><a href=\\"https://pk.linkedin.com/school/ucp-official/\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-linkedin\\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n    \\r\\n    <li><a href=\\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTQwZphZ14iiRE1g3lHkpBA\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-youtube\\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n    <li><a href=\\"https://www.instagram.com/ucpofficial/\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-instagram \\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n    </div>\\r\\n<div class=\\"social-footer\\">\\r\\n    <ul class=\\"list-inline pull-right social-list csssocl\\" style=\\"\\r\\n    clear: both; text-align: center;\\">\\r\\n    <li><a href=\\"https://apps.apple.com/pk/app/ucp/id1261714987\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-apple\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n<li><a href=\\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=edu.pgc.ucp&hl=en\\" class=\\"btn btn-default social-icon\\"><i class=\\"fa fa-android\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\"></i></a></li>\\r\\n<li><a href=\\"http://fm.ucp.edu.pk/9\\n\\n[Truncated for database storage]", "wordCount": 1211, "matchPages": 32, "matchWords": 15, "commonWords": 15, "uniqueWords": 1196, "matchPercent": 1, "commonPercent": 1, "duplicateWords": 0, "duplicatePercent": 0}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/blog/university-campus-life/", "text": "UCP 101, a Beginners Guide to an Amazing Journey Home » Blog » UCP 101, a Beginners Guide to an Amazing Journey University life is an amazing new life for all the students. Every year a number of freshers join a new university making a certain year’s batch. A great number of students enrolled in number of programs divided into a number of sections make a beautiful lot of youngsters full of dreams. University of Central Punjab offers a rather more interesting experience to its students. It is only a matter of exploring a little and getting acquainted with the surrounding possibilities which takes the students one step closer to live their dream university campus life. You certainly get to have a wonderful time is you use all the facilities that are there for your own good. There is much more to life at UCP then taking classing. You certainly wouldn’t just want to get done with your classes and go home. Once you get the taste of all the fun stuff you could do while studying at UCP you wouldn’t want to miss out on each day of your time while you are here. Table of Contents Toggle Things that ensure your amazing university campus life: Campus that is beautiful and bestowed with endless possibilities The life university campus offers you, has a lot of room for you to find what you may need to be able to explore your inner passions. UCP university campus is fully equipped with the facilities that students can use to keep themselves occupied in doing productive activities rather than idling away their time. At the campus, University of Central Punjab maintains a highly furnished library that is beautiful and comfortable enough for the students to want to spend time there. UCP campus life become a lot more than a dull student life with the beauty of its campus’ green grounds, a swimming pool, a gymnasium, a food street, a relaxing room, a snooker area, and much more. Your university campus life will bring you a fresh new day everyday if you only decide to play. Student life of your dreams The student life at UCP has a colorful flavor to it. For those who explore the experience of their life as a student is entirely different. Your student life experience begins with you choosing to spend time within the university walls. When you think of a fun student life topic of classes and studies emerges. It is certainly an integral part of the student life experience to live through the time inside classrooms and to interact with different teachers. Students often fail to actually recognize a very crucial part that in student life ideas that are shared inside classroom leave a very meaningful impact on the overall student experience. Somehow the awkward classroom interactions, the funny exchanges, the remarks, the senseless questions, the dialogues and other things combined contribute a lot in making student life funny. Student life on campus of University of Central Punjab can be pretty busy amid taking classes and utilizing the space around for all other exciting activities. A student society fit for each of you Life at UCP is full of endless possibilities. You will have so many doors open to you waiting for you to step in. There is a whole list of societies actively working for and contributing in skill development and talent nourishment of youngsters. Student life for a university student becomes more interesting with university clubs and societies. A student is able to become more than oneself when he or she is a part of something bigger. With UCP having a great number of student societies to join that are running to provide a great platform of opportunities to the youth it becomes a great adventure for many students who becomes a part of any society’s family. The place at university of society and it’s a activities has a great significance. University of Central Punjab gives great significance to the student clubs and societies and therefore there a various things happening at UCP campus at the same time. It is to the advantage of student system of getting involved with activities and societies at UCP are very easy and engaging. It is to a student’s advantage that he can opt for just the kind of exposure he wants at UCP. There is a sporting club for the sportsmen spirit, the university sports club polishes the innate skills of every player who chooses to participate in any sports. Among all the university societies the UCP Sports Club becomes the most prominent because of 6 year record of bringing All Pakistan Sports General Trophy to the house consecutively. The university students get a great platform to turn their passions into professions at UCP. There are many great names of professionals working in various fields that are proud alum of UCP. For a UCP student jobs mostly mean doing what they are meant to be. The ability to explore and polish their talents during a UCP journey they get to know what they are best at and find the places they belong. Every university society offers the students with something of their own individualistic interest. The university campus life becomes a whole new experience when a student chooses one of the societies and clubs. For a student, sports may lead to lifelong profession. Some student may get to flourish in the music industry or drama, film, fashion, journalism, business etc. The chances are always there. Possibilities remain open. There are also opportunities of international studies provided to the students. Some programs encourage the students to form their own teams under a certain club or a society as social groups and they are able to from a student association. The international ties of UCP provide the students with the exactly the exposure they need to excel in their professional lives. By engaging in international programs many students have been able to score a studentship for themselves. The students of UCP make another great use of their free time by becoming volunteers in service of humanity. At UCP student union volunteering for different causes is a very beautiful thing we see. It is an experience of its own done for a greater cause. Thus, at UCP the university campus life enables you to be more than yourself. You become a part of something bigger and something that is going to keep growing with your more and more every day. All you need to do is to open your eyes, look around and see. International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "title": "UCP 101, a Beginners Guide to an Amazing Journey - University of Central Punjab", "sizeKb": 217.7, "matches": [{"text": "International Programs Merit List Apply Online Our Newsletter Facebook Twitter LinkedIn WhatsApp WhatsApp Us X", "type": "common", "matchPages": [{"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/faculty-of-sciences/", "title": "Faculty of Sciences - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/seminar-on-general-awareness-of-traffic-laws/", "title": "Seminar on General Awareness of Traffic Law - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/skype-chat-session-with-the-head-of-school-massey-university-new-zealand/", "title": "Skype Chat Session with The Head of School, Massey University NZ"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/guest-lecture/", "title": "Guest Lecture - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/session-on-disaster-management-awareness-investigating-today-to-save-lives-tomorrow/", "title": "Session on Disaster Management Awareness: Investigating Today - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/psychology-society-seminar/", "title": "Psychology Society Seminar - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/levis-recruitment-drive-for-the-positions-of-store-managers/", "title": "Levi’s Recruitment Drive for The Positions of Store Managers - UCP"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/ramadan/", "title": "Ramadan - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/trophy-comes-home/", "title": "Trophy Comes Home - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/cultural-carnival/", "title": "Cultural Carnival - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/shab-e-midhat/", "title": "Shab-e-Midhat - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/life-at-ucp-events/marketing-gala/", "title": "Marketing Gala - University of Central Punjab"}, {"url": "https://ucp.edu.pk/news/united-nations-academic-impact-membership/", "title": "United Nations Academic Impa